7
00:00:17,870 --> 00:00:20,730
She has to read a story for ten

8
00:00:20,730 --> 00:00:21,350
minutes.

9
00:00:22,170 --> 00:00:23,990
Reading makes her sleepy.

10
00:00:24,930 --> 00:00:27,590
